              "text": "Cal had a plan. A tan cat sat on a mat by a bag. The cat ran past a pan and back to the mat. Cal sat on the mat and had a snack. The cat tapped the bag, but Cal grabbed it fast. The bag had a cap, a map, and a pack. Cal put the bag on a rack. A small rat ran past the mat. The cat ran at the rat, but the rat hid in a crack. Cal gave the cat a pat. The cat ran back and had a nap. Then Cal had another task. A black flag had to go on a stand. Cal set the flag, packed the bag, and put the cap on the rack. At last, Cal had one last look. The bag, cap, map, and flag were set. The plan was done. Cal was glad, and the tan cat was glad too. Cal sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack. Cal sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack. Cal sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack. Cal sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack. Cal sat back on the mat. The cat had a nap. The bag and cap stayed safe on the rack."
