              "text": "Nick had a little task. A big tin bin sat by a mat. A thin stick sat in the bin. Nick picked the stick up and put it by a small bag. A quick little pig ran past the bag in a zigzag. Nick had to grin. The pig did not sit still. It sniffed the mat, tipped the bin, and ran up a hill. Nick fixed the bin and put the stick back in it. Then Nick sat for a bit. A little chick came near. It picked at a bit of food and hid by the bin. Nick did not grab it. Nick sat still and let the chick come close. A soft wind hit the hill. Nick put a lid on the bin so the bits in it did not spill. Then Nick had a quick snack. A cat sat on the mat and blinked. The cat did not hiss. It sat still as the pig, chick, and Nick rested. At last, Nick packed the bag, checked the lid, and picked up the stick. The task was finished. Nick felt glad. It had been a busy but fun visit. Nick sat still for a bit. The pig sniffed, the chick picked, and the cat blinked. The bin and lid stayed fixed. Nick sat still for a bit. The pig sniffed, the chick picked, and the cat blinked. The bin and lid stayed fixed. Nick sat still for a bit. The pig sniffed, the chick picked, and the cat blinked. The bin and lid stayed fixed."
